@segment  climb-f15-f21
@title    Climb — Focus 15 to Focus 21
@levels   F21
@fixed
@duration ~1m

say From Focus 15, we continue the climb. The next state is Focus 21. The threshold between the physical and the non-physical.
pause 5
say Count with me.
pause 3
level F21
say Fifteen.
pause 3
say Sixteen.
pause 3
say Seventeen.
pause 3
say Eighteen.
pause 3
say Nineteen.
pause 3
say Twenty.
pause 3
say Twenty-one.
pause 5
